re going to be visiting both new and  familiar locations  now there is one more official source of  news for the game that  also mentions other locations by name  and that is the adrian rob  playstation blog post again i'll link it  down in the description if you haven't  had a chance to check it out yet  there's a lot of interesting stuff in  this one for sure the bit that stands  out to me and relates to our video today  is when rob  says quote the forbidden forest was  still forbidden and home to centaurs not  likely keen on human interaction  goblins were around but this [ __ ]  certainly didn't work at gringotts  the village of hogsmeade was there and  an ollivander has been making juan since  bc often the difficult task is choosing  which details we  aren't going to explore now you have to  notice here he doesn't necessarily  confirm  any of these locations he even says the  part at the end about how it's difficult  for them to leave places out  of course because of that faq page we  already know the forbidden forest  is indeed in as is hogsmeade but what  about those other two gringotts and  ollivanders  well i think when you take his mention  of ollivanders here plus the fact that  we have  this official screenshot i think we can  kick off our list today  with ollivanders what little we know  about the story of the game indicates  our character receives a late  acceptance letter to hogwarts now we  don't really know why we aren't sure if  we'll have done  any magic beforehand if we come from a  wizarding family or a muggle family we  just don't know at this point but what  we do know is that any wizard or witch  going to hogwarts will need a wand  and when you consider just how long the  olivanders have been making wands it  should come as no surprise when we see  the wand shop early in the game  to me the bigger question is what other  locations of diagon alley might we see  and that leads me to number two  gringotts  we're introduced to the wizarding bank 